-- The recovery trap (w1-b): the balance is not the block. Twin of 120-cast-block.bqn (trap section). (was w1-cast-block-b)
-- Wand [SB, Double, SB, SB]: the first bolt ends the block at slot 0, but the Double at slot 1 pushes the balance back up to 1 — a bal >= 0 test would draw the whole wand. Membership is the running minimum's story, never the balance's.
--! registry ../registries/121-cast-block-b.reg
--! expect bal = 0 0 1 0 -1
--! expect minBal = 0 0 0 0 -1
--! expect member = 0 1 0 0 0

Spell , Bal = 1 + (+\ (DrawAdd - 1) @ Spell)
Spell , MinBal = 0 - (max\ (0 - Bal) @ Spell)
Spell @ deck & (Slot == 0 | prev.MinBal > 0) , +Member
